   1761  fcf0							; HotOverlapBody — MOVED from bank0 (S5.3, kernel `jmp HotOverlapFlag` at
   1762  fcf0							; $FE80 tramp -> `jmp $FCF0` here). Fold-free: the hot-rect stream (RoomRects)
   1763  fcf0							; is level data in THIS bank, so the 7 `jsr FoldIndirect` become direct
   1764  fcf0							; `lda (FetchPtr),Y` (one less push level on the hot path too).
   1765  fcf0							; Behavior (full docs moved with the body): if the player's proposed tile
   1766  fcf0							; range (CollisionCell*) overlaps any hot-only rect, set Temp bit 7 (HotBump).
   1767  fcf0							; Called from PlayerHitsMap HIT while CollisionCell* still describe the
