   2080  fe48							; bank2's byte-identical copy) back to OvShutBand's jsr — A and C
   2081  fe48							; survive both, stack depth unchanged (+2 for the jsr only). Out
   2082  fe48							; (2026-10-14b): C=0 passable / C=1 + A≠0 kill / C=1 + A=0 solid block.
   2083  fe48							; Kill semantics (user spec 2026-10-14): hot band (MetaB b6) = touching
   2084  fe48							; any closed slice kills; cold band = containment (sprite fully inside
   2085  fe48							; closed slices), closing phase only (Rule 1). Full logic: bank3 VCS3
   2086  fe48							; (header there).
