   2313  ff59							; VcrShutter — sprite-shutter staging (vcrunch_shutter_plan Phase B).
   2314  ff59							; Tail-entered from PhVcrPre (PhaseBlink walk, 0 pushes — the VBL chain sits
   2315  ff59							; on the measured SP floor) and tail-exits at .PhRec.
   2316  ff59							;   IN:  FetchPtr = hot record stream, Y = record base (class byte)
